  "title": "Claude Agent SDK (Rust): parity with TS SDK 0.3.296",
  "body": "Bring `crates/claude_agent_sdk` from TS Claude Agent SDK 0.3.289 to 0.3.296 (Claude Code 2.1.296).\n\nPort every wire, type, and option change in the 0.3.290 to 0.3.296 CHANGELOG: `claude_code_version` in the initialize response, `autoCompactWindow` on AgentDefinition, `overageEnabled` on rate-limit info, subagent `agent_id`, task `run_id` and `parent_task_id`, the `--flag=value` argument form, sandbox merge semantics, and the 4,096 `updatedPermissions` denial rule. Update `UPSTREAM_SDK_VERSION`, PARITY.md, and the README; `scripts/check-claude-sdk-parity.sh latest` must exit 0.\n",
